<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-BUBKA WINS WORLD POLE VAULT TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BUBKA WINS WORLD POLE VAULT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukrainian Sergei Bubka won the world pole vault gold medal on Sunday.</p>
<p>Russian Maksim Tarasov took the silver and American Dean Starkey the bronze.</p>
</text>
